This directory contains the upstream C++ text-dictionary, segmentation and
conversion subset, without Config, SimpleConverter or binary dictionary
backends. SerializedValues.hpp explicitly includes <cstdint> for C++20
toolchains that no longer expose integer types through transitive includes;
all other upstream source files are unmodified. The local opencc_config.h
selects the upstream template's configuration with Darts disabled.

The DFCN core compiles these sources directly as C++20 with
Opencc_BUILT_AS_STATIC defined. No additional runtime library, alternate
toolchain, CMake build or dictionary generator is required.
